        "text": "Behind every candle is a woman’s dream of a\nbrighter tomorrow.\nAt Ascension Seva, our handcrafted candles, diyas\nand festive hampers celebrate creativity, courage\nand women empowerment. Each creation carries\na story of hope, dignity and the desire for\nindependence.\nWhen you purchase from us, you do more than\nbring beauty into your home — you support a\nwoman’s journey towards a brighter future.\nBuy with love. Gift with purpose. Empower a\nwoman.\nWith gratitude,\nTeam Ascension Seva"
